        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679520/extras/0696213ef5d01d90594f5bb70f3b4932.avif?t=1784294995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679520/extras_big/0696213ef5d01d90594f5bb70f3b4932.avif?t=1784294995 width=800 height=388 /></span><i>Fallen Hunter</i> is a dark fantasy action-RPG where you step into the shattered world of  war. Fight with two unique playable characters—each with their own story, combat style, and moral path—as you fight to uncover the truth behind a corrupted order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield blades  to stand against monstrous creatures and lost souls. Explore forgotten ruins, devastated lands, and ancient temples in a narrative-driven experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precise third-person combat, challenging enemies, and a haunting, lore-rich world, <i>Fallen Hunter</i> invites you to defy judgment—and reclaim your destiny.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679520/extras/0696213ef5d01d90594f5bb70f3b4932.avif?t=1784294995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679520/extras_big/0696213ef5d01d90594f5bb70f3b4932.avif?t=1784294995 width=800 height=388 /></span><i>Fallen Hunter</i> is a dark fantasy action-RPG where you step into the shattered world of  war. Fight with two unique playable characters—each with their own story, combat style, and moral path—as you fight to uncover the truth behind a corrupted order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield blades  to stand against monstrous creatures and lost souls. Explore forgotten ruins, devastated lands, and ancient temples in a narrative-driven experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precise third-person combat, challenging enemies, and a haunting, lore-rich world, <i>Fallen Hunter</i> invites you to defy judgment—and reclaim your destiny.</p>",
